    // into the planar fill ID framebuffer.  Non-behind planar geometry writes
    // its feature ID + 1 into the R channel (0 = no feature) and returns.
    // No material / lighting / post-process stages are needed.
    // ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
